  "id": "2026-10-02-an-idle-poll-ends-an-inline-track-rename-in-ten-languages",
  "date": "2026-10-02",
  "subject": "whether an inline track rename keeps Logic's keyboard focus, and takes typing, while the server sits idle, in ten languages",
  "question": "With no server, with a server without the #1079 yield, and with one that has it, does the rename field Track > Rename Track opens keep the focus for 20 s while a key is typed every second?",
  "verdict": "works",
  "surface": "arrange.track_headers",
  "issues": [
    1079
  ],
  "host": {
    "app": "Logic Pro",
    "version": "12.3",
    "build": "6674",
    "locale": "ko-KR",
    "os": "macOS 26.3 (25D125)"
  },
  "reverify": {
    "kind": "script",
    "command": "/usr/bin/python3 Scripts/livekit/probe_1079_rename_keeps_focus.py <control-binary> <candidate-binary> <out.json> --samples 2",
    "expected": "in every language every no-server and candidate sample opened its rename and kept the field for 20 s with its value growing; the control lost the field in every sample that ran. Exit 0 also needs every control sample to have run",
    "cost": "needs LPM_LIVE_LOCK naming a held lock, LPM_LOCALE_FIXTURE, the 2-Set Korean source and two debug builds; about four minutes per language"
  },
  "depends": [
    "Sources/LogicProMCP/State/StatePoller.swift:backgroundTickYields",
    "Sources/LogicProMCP/Channels/AccessibilityChannel+Tracks.swift:readLogicKeyboardFocus",
    "Sources/LogicProMCP/Accessibility/AXValueExtractors.swift:inferTrackType",
    "Scripts/livekit/probe_1079_rename_keeps_focus.py:sample",
    "Scripts/livekit/ax_1079_rename_focus.swift:focus"
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "evidence/2026-10-02-1079-rename-focus-ten-languages.json"
  ],
  "method": "probe_1079_rename_keeps_focus.py ran at 0383a5ef in ten languages, two samples per condition, on a fresh launch of the locale-campaign fixture per language. The candidate was the debug build of 0383a5ef, whose background cycle ends where a yield is decided, whose track walk asks before each header and before every AXHelp read, and whose publication asks the focus before it starts and before each resource read; the control was the debug build of the 086821fd tree with StatePoller.swift as on main 3cb68e44, which has no yield. Per language the conditions ran in the order none, candidate, control. Before each sample the probe left the focus on the Tracks rail, with an Escape only while Logic held the keyboard and a text field had the focus, and recorded each round. Each sample raised the arrange window, focused the Tracks header rail, pressed Track > Rename Track, and counted the rename open only once the focus had been read as a text field (polled every 0.1 s for 2 s). It then read the focus every 0.5 s for 20 s and typed K at the HID tap every second, under the 2-Set Korean source, and recorded when the focus left the field and how the field's value length grew.",
